  "chapter": 753,
  "signer": "KATHY HOCHUL",
  "text": " \n                APPROVAL MEMORANDUM - No. 75 Chapter 753\n \n         MEMORANDUM filed with Senate Bill Number 582, entitled:\n \n    \"AN  ACT to amend the general business law, in relation to prohibit-\n        ing the sale of sodium nitrate and sodium nitrite to any  person\n        under the age of twenty-one\"\n \n    APPROVED\n \n  This  bill  would  prohibit  the  sale  of  sodium  nitrate and sodium\nnitrite, which have been used for  self-harm  and  suicide,  to  persons\nunder the age of twenty-one.\n \n  I  share  the  sponsors'  goals  in addressing the youth mental health\ncrisis and the increasing rates of suicide  in  young  people.  The  new\nprevalence  of  sodium  nitrate  as a tool for self-harm is a disturbing\ndevelopment and requires state action. However, technical  changes  were\nnecessary to clarify the scope of the prohibition on sales.\n \n  I have reached an agreement with the Legislature to enact these chang-\nes.  On the basis of this agreement, I am pleased to sign this bill.\n \n  This bill is approved.                         (signed) KATHY HOCHUL\n \n                                ______\n",
  "year": 2023
 },
